  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your body is designed to be agile with some protection. Your integrated armour is light armour in the leather armour group that grants a +2 item bonus to AC, a Dex cap of +3, a check penalty of –1, and a Strength value of 12. This armour has no bulk, but you can never wear other armour or remove your integrated armour; however, you still don't become fatigued from sleeping. Finally, you can etch armour runes onto your armour as normal. </p>"
    },
